                                                "sense_id": "4f1bd747-be04-3a05-9ed8-6e4167281c35",
                                                "text": "\"We have to sing for our supper, and that's something the young people are coming to terms with,\" said Dr. Robin Erbacher, 33, a postdoc at Fermilab."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67a906e7-fda9-44fc-812f-a28e011fdd36",
                                                "sense_id": "4f1bd747-be04-3a05-9ed8-6e4167281c35",
                                                "text": "Many of the postdocs are almost 40 before they start their first permanent positions and begin saving for retirement."
                                            },
